-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",357,{
[11393]="70046BF9\n1\tDefeat spiders and destroy spider-webs\t\n2\tDestroy spider-webs in Thurindath (total: 8)\030Defeat spiders in Thurindath (total: 8)\tSpiders and their webs can be found within the old Ranger refuge of Thurindath in south-eastern North Ithilien. You have discovered the refuge of Thurindath overrun with great spiders and their webs. You should defeat them and clear the refuge of their webbing.\n3\tTalk to Mablung at Henneth Annûn\tMablung can be found at Henneth Annûn. You have cleared the old Ranger refuge of Thurindath of spiders and their webs, but you should inform the Rangers of what you discovered.\n",
[11394]="7000AE1E\n1\tDeliver the sinew to Sergeant-at-Arms Caddafrith\030Collect drake-sinew (total: 5)\tDrakes can be found in Arador's End, north of Tol Ascarnen. Sergeant-at-Arms Caddafrith has asked you to assist her in crafting a horn to call forces to fight against Angmar's army when they assail Tol Ascarnen. To do this, she asks that you collect sinews from the drakes of Arador's End with which to bind the Horn of Tol Ascarnen. She suggests you take allies.\n",
[11395]="7000B0E3\n1\tLleva el vino dulce de fresa a Baldwin Colazorro\030Recoge vino dulce de fresa (total: 5)\tBaldwin Colazorro está en la Casa de los Mathoms, en Cavada Grande, en la Comarca. Baldwin te ha pedido que le lleves cinco botellas de vino dulce de fresa para los cocineros de la Sociedad de los Mathoms.\n",
[11396]="70058578\n1\tConfront the raiding party of the Drekvath River\tThe path across the Drekvath River can be found east of Shakal-atrâd. You should confront the raiding party of the Drekvath River.\n2\tTalk to Yrsa Spearwife on the road\tThe Drekvath River can be found east of Shakal-atrâd. You should talk to Yrsa Spearwife by the Drekvath River.\n3\tTalk to Yrsa Spearwife at Shakal-atrâd\tYrsa Spearwife can be found at Shakal-atrâd. You should talk to Yrsa Spearwife at Shakal-atrâd.\n4\tShakal-atrâd can be found in Elderslade. You should give Beorining-made spears to the dwarves at Shakal-atrâd.\t\n5\tAssist Thyra at Shakal-atrâd\030Assist Sighild at Shakal-atrâd\030Assist Hertha at Shakal-atrâd\tThyra, Sighild, and Hertha can all be found at Shakal-atrâd. You should assist the Beornings at Shakal-atrâd.\n6\tFind and aid Skarding Wargsbane\tSkarding Wargsbane can be found somewhere on the battlefield. You should find and aid Skarding Wargsbane.\n7\tAssist Langhár at Zarkul-sulûn\030Assist Varthmath at Zarkul-sulûn\tLanghár and Varthmath can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You should assist Langhár and Varthmath.\n8\tTalk to Langhár at Zarkul-sulûn\tLanghár can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You should talk to Langhár.\n",
[11397]="7006B9D0\n1\tSpeak with Agazi near the rockslide to the west\tSpeak with Agazi near the rockslide on the road to Ambarûl to the west.\n2\tDefeat spiny lizards (total: 8)\tDefeat spiny lizards near the rockslide blocking the path to Ambarûl.\n3\tReturn to Agazi\tReturn to Agazi near the rockslide blocking the path to Ambarûl in the west.\n4\tSpeak with Balgiba in the Channel of Bâdizal\tSpeak with Balgiba near the Channel of Bâdizal to the south of Maurûsh.\n5\tCollect tortoise shells (total: 5)\tBalgiba has asked you to gather tortoise shells for him near the Channel of Bâdizal for the armour he is trying to craft.\n6\tReturn to Balgiba with the tortoise shells\tBring the tortoise shells back to Balgiba in the Channel of Bâdizal.\n7\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir\tReturn to Galâmka in Maurûsh and update him on Agazi and Balgiba.\n",
[11398]="70002CD2\n1\tDestruir catapultas (total: 2)\030Destruir torres de asedio (total: 2)\tLas máquinas de guerra -- torres de asedio y catapultas -- de los Angmarim están en la parte oriental de Ram Dúath. Tuokki te ha pedido que ayudes a destruir las torres de asedio y catapultas de los Angmarim.\n2\tHabla con Chief Tuokki\tEl líder Tuokki está en el campamento Suuri-lehmä en Ram Dúath. Debes regresar con Tuokki para informarle de tu éxito.\n",
[11399]="70017590\n1\tEntrega los objetos a Frosti Sacudetierra en la Mansión de Thorin\tFrosti Sacudetierra está en la Mansión de Thorin, junto a los subastadores al sur del trono. Deberías llevarle las piezas a Frosti Sacudetierra para que pueda arrojar algo de luz sobre lo que podría estar sucediendo\n2\tRegresa con Brazofero en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo\tBrazofero se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo de Moria. Frosti Sacudetierra te ha dado una efigie con runas que podría ayudarte a llamar la atención del espectro orco. Deberías regresar con Brazofero en Moria y él te dirá qué hacer a continuación.\n",
[11400]="70046896\n1\tYou should bring the armour to the soldiers in and around Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor.\t\n2\tTalk to Angbor\tYou should talk to Angbor, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\n",
[11401]="7001B702\n1\tReclama el patio inferior\tLas puertas de Dannenglor han sido selladas. Para infiltraros en las antiguas ruinas, tendréis que entrar por el patio inferior y ascender.\n2\tReclama la entrada sur\030Reclama el puente oeste\030Reclama la terraza este\tEl corazón de Dannenglor es un gran patio abierto con una puerta al sur, un puente al oeste y una terraza al este. Deberéis controlar los tres para poder avanzar.\n3\tAbre el patio superior\tEl pequeño patio superior es lo único que te separa del hechicero.\n4\tDerrota al hechicero y reclama la cámara del hechicero\tPara tomar Dannenglor para la Hueste Dorada y liberar a sus prisioneros, el hechicero que reside allí debe ser derrotado y su cámara reclamada.\n",
[11402]="70029FC2\n1\tCompleta 'Ataque contra Dannenglor' con un grupo de incursión\tVarios elfos y exploradores han sido hechos prisioneros por un hechicero en las antiguas ruinas élficas de Dannenglor.\n",
[11403]="700276EE\n1\tDerrota a los saqueadores dunlendinos (total: 6)\030Derrota a los desvalijadores dunlendinos (total: 4)\tLos saqueadores dunlendinos fueron vistos por última vez dispersándose por las colinas al oeste del Vado del Isen. El intendente de los Rohirrim te ha pedido que persigas a los saqueadores dunlendinos que atacaron el campamento y que los expulses de la zona.\n2\tHabla con el intendente de los Rohirrim\tEl intendente de los Rohirrim se encuentra en el Vado del Isen. Deberías volver con el intendente de los Rohirrim y decirle que has logrado expulsar a los saqueadores dunlendinos.\n",
[11404]="70028C92\n1\tHabla con Answith en el Valle del Isen\tAnswith ha acampado al otro lado de una torre, al oeste de Brôntrig y al sur de Puente del Cuarto. Ardwyn te ha pedido que encuentres a este explorador y le prestes tu ayuda.\n",
[11405]="70028C9C\n1\tDestruye los estandartes (total: 5)\tPuedes encontrar estandartes en la entrada de los pasos de montaña, al sur del campamento de Garrun. Garrun te ha pedido que destruyas los estandartes de los hombres de las Tierras Brunas colocados a lo largo de los pasos de montaña.\n2\tHabla con Garrun en el Valle del Isen\tGarrun está en su campamento, al norte de Cuvnerth y de los pasos de montaña. Debes acudir a Garrun e informarle de que has retirado los estandartes.\n",
[11406]="7005B1F3\n1\tOrkish weapons can be found around Durshulot to the north-west, on the middle tier. Rékkur has asked you to destroy these weapons and sabotage the Orcs' periodic skirmishes with the Gabil'akkâ.\t\n2\tTalk to Rékkur in Aslíf\tYou have destroyed weapons around Durshulot. Rékkur in Aslíf will be glad to hear the news.\n",
[11407]="7002FEC8\n1\tDerrota a los hostigadores trasgos (total: 6)\030Elimina a los rompesitios de Mordor (total: 3)\tFastred quiere que elimines a los jinetes durante tu viaje a Walstow. Los jinetes orcos y trasgos se encuentran justo al borde del camino hacia el este.\n2\tHabla con Winsig\tWinsig está en el salón del Hidromiel de Walstow.\n",
[11408]="70058573\n1\tTalk to Aighrig\tYou should discuss plans with Aighrig. She stands before the stairs to Annâk-khurfu.\n2\tDefeat bat-keepers at Tithzagáf (total: 4)\030Rescue infant bats (total: 5)\030Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side\tThe cave Tithzagáf is located on the island of Grytholm, to the north-west of Annâk-khurfu. You should defeat the bat-keepers there, as well as rescue infant bats from their influence.\n3\tUse the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side\030Deliver the infant bats to Aighrig\tYou and Aighrig have rescued several infant bats from the Angmarim. You should give the bats to Aighrig.\n",
[11409]="7000AC57\n1\tDeliver the kindling to Soldier Glat at Tol Ascarnen\030Recoge Grimwood-kindling (total: 5)\tSearch the area of Hithlad for the kindling needed to make the arrow shafts. Hithlad and the Grimwood forest are south of Tol Ascarnen. In an effort to better fortify Tol Ascarnen, the War-tyrant has called to the goblins at Grothum and told his soldiers to craft bolts for the goblins to shoot into the tunnel at the mouth of the keep. It falls to you to collect the wood for the shafts.\n",
[11410]="7006B8EC\n1\tFind the Orc supplies in the northern part of Maurûsh\tFind the supplies the Orcs are using in the northern area of Maurûsh.\n2\tSabotage Orc supplies (total: 4)\tSabotage the Orc supplies you have found in the northern area of Maurûsh.\n3\tFind the Orc supplies in the western part of Maurush\tFind the supplies the Orcs are using in the western area of Maurûsh.\n4\tSabotage Orc supplies (total: 4)\tSabotage the Orc supplies you have found in the western area of Maurûsh.\n5\tSpeak to Galamka\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir and inform him of your success.\n",
[11411]="7000AC58\n1\tTalk to Soldier Kaasak at Tol Ascarnen\030Recoge Drake-sinew (total: 5)\tThe Wintersebb-drakes are found north, in sections near the Hoarwell's source and at the foot of the Misty Mountains. Angmar's forces at Tol Ascarnen are crafting a great horn to call reinforcements to the fight when the Free Peoples return to assault the area. Kaasak has tasked you with collecting sinew from the Wintersebb-drakes to secure the many horns that will adorn the post.\n",
[11412]="7003FF25\n1\tDefeat Vandals (total: 6)\tThe Great Hall is the crown jewel of Dol Amroth.\n",
[11413]="70065F7B\n1\tPick up the box of pins\030Pick up the bundle of rope\tWharf master Annúngil has asked you to replace the damaged ropes and pins on the Rosigil. You should pick up the box of pins and bundles of new rope. The box of pins and the rope are next to Annúngil, on the docks in the Dol Amroth bay.\n2\tReplace stripped pins (total: 4)\030Replace frayed rope (total: 2)\tYou are now armed with fresh pins and tightly woven ropes. You should replace the pins on the Rosigil and the rope on the docks. The Rosigil is moored in the Dol Amroth bay.\n3\tReturn to Annúngil\tYou should let Annúngil know that you have replaced the damaged pins and piles of rope on the Rosigil. The wharf master is on a dock in the Dol Amroth bay.\n",
[11414]="70027320\n1\tEncuentra a Mostun y desafíalo a combate\030Encuentra a Gaenor y desafíala a combate\tMostun y Gaenor están en algún lugar del pueblo de Tûr Morva, en Tâl Methedras. Mair quiere que desafíes a dos maestros de las artes de combate en Tûr Morva, para que puedan aprender de tus técnicas de lucha.\n2\tHabla con Mair en Tûr Morva\tMair está junto a una roca grande en la mitad norte del pueblo de Tûr Morva, en Tâl Methedras. Has derrotado tanto a Mostun como a Gaenor, y ambos han aprendido algunas de tus técnicas de combate.\n",
[11415]="70067C48\n1\tMake your way to Grijâti, the Haradrim camp south-east of Jax Phanâl. Once there, find the ritual circle and plant the banner to draw out and challenge the strongest of the Haradrim warriors.\t\n2\tHabla con Stúkha\tYou defeated the Haradrim leader, and he said he would honour the pacts of the past. You should return to Stúkha at Jax Phanâl.\n",
[11416]="70015465\n1\tEncuentra a Krum y habla con él\tKrum se encuentra al norte de la Cámara de la Encrucijada, cerca de Ninknakh Faltor. Líkmund te ha pedido que hables con Krum sobre el campamento de trasgos que ha encontrado y le ayudes como puedas.\n2\tHabla con Líkmund en la Cámara de la Encrucijada\tLíkmund está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al sur de Ninknakh Faltor. El campamento de Ninknakh Faltor era grande y estaba bien fortificado, y solo pudiste explorarlo en parte. Deberías informar a Líkmund de lo que has averiguado.\n",
[11417]="7004DA42\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[11418]="7004DB8C\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[11419]="7004DB8D\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[11420]="7004DA3F\n1\tHabla con Rock\tAl completar esta misión, recibirás una asignación de moneda de trueque de los Bastiones del Norte.\n",
[11421]="7004178A\n1\tFree slaves aboard the Corsair ships (total: 6)\tThe Corsair ships can be reached using the boat to the south of Thandor. You should board the Corsair ships and free the captured slaves.\n2\tTalk to Thandor\tThandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Thandor.\n",
[11422]="70022419\n1\tEncuentra la Escuela de Tham Mírdain\tLa Escuela de Tham Mírdain se encuentra en Mirobel, en la región suroeste de Eregion. Gelriwen de Echad Mirobel te ha pedido que encuentres la entrada a una antigua escuela.\n",
[11423]="70055008\n1\tHabla con Javatar\tAl completar esta misión, se te marcará como habiendo completado Discípulo del enemigo\n",
[11424]="7000ACA0\n1\tEntrega tus Estudios de lo Desconocido a Cachúnir en Rivendel\030Redacta Estudios de lo Desconocido (total: 5)\tCachúnir está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls. Cachúnir te ha pedido que redactes estudios sobre lo Desconocido y se los lleves.\n",
})
